u+1}](F^{\mathrm{sep}})$ into $H_
u$ with kernel $H_1$ of order $\ell^{2g}$. The order computation in step 1.1 makes its image have order $\ell^{2g
u}$, so it is surjective. Choose a basis of $H_1$ and recursively lift each basis vector through these maps. The lifted vectors form a basis of $H_{
u+1}$ over $\mathbb Z/\ell^{
u+1}\mathbb Z$: a relation, after applying $\ell$, has all coefficients divisible by $\ell^
